{"h":"durango-boots-db5554","t":"Men's Rebel by Durango Patriotic Pull-On Western Flag Boots (DB5554)","b":"Durango","c":"Boots","d":"Details \n Pull on your patriotic pride in this men\u2019s 11\" American Flag Rebel\u2122 by Durango\u00ae style. The look, level of comfort, and heel height are ideal for you!\n The foot and trim are made from oiled, dark brown full-grain leather. The square toe adds a very traditional flair to this western boot, but the focal point is the shaft, which proudly displays the American flag. The footbed will provide cushioning, ease the weight of your steps and it circulates the air within these boots. As you are walking, you'll have more stability because this pull-on boot features a tempered steel shank, and the double row welt stitching adds additional durability.\n Show how much you love your country in this men\u2019s 11\" American Flag Rebel\u2122 by Durango\u00ae style. Get your pair today!\n- Square toe\n- EVA midsole\n- Tempered steel shank\n- Cushion Flex insole\n- Rolled shank area\n- Soft mesh lining\n- Contoured, ventilated and removable cushion footbed\n- Double row sole stitch\n- Distressed full-grain leather foot, collar and pull straps with faux shaft\n- Abrasion-resistant translucent rubber outsole","tags":["Men / Man / Hombre / Caballero"],"imgs":["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_LARGE_fb91724c-aa44-4912-a0c8-f24697ba8d00.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_lifestyle_LARGE_5b630eab-bfb2-4230-b268-762db68384a0.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_2_LARGE_ab588eca-337f-4f26-aeea-3ea24858663b.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_8_LARGE_4eafef4b-68de-470d-ba82-d0c636537a6a.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_3_LARGE_561dca4b-e7a9-42f7-8e95-31b989268847.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/DB5554_4_LARGE_244fa40f-4c84-4a19-bf22-